  "body": "To view the property documents, copy this link into your browser:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/Z3FQ\r\n\r\nPerched proudly along one of Stanmore Bay's most tightly held coastal streets, this exceptional clifftop residence commands breathtaking panoramic views that stretch from Whale Cove across Red Beach and Orewa, all the way to Hatfields Beach and Waiwera. It is a truly spectacular outlook, where the ever-changing colours of the ocean and coastline provide a magnificent backdrop to everyday life.\r\n\r\nDesigned to embrace its extraordinary surroundings, the home enjoys an abundance of natural light, generous proportions and an effortless connection between indoor and outdoor living. Expansive decks extend from the living spaces, creating inviting places to entertain friends, gather with family or simply sit back with a morning coffee and take in the magnificent outlook. Whether hosting a summer barbecue or enjoying a quiet evening at home, the setting provides a backdrop that is difficult to replicate.\r\n\r\nInside, there is a wonderful sense of space, with generous living areas and well-appointed bedrooms providing flexibility for families, professionals and those seeking a special coastal retreat. The layout offers room to spread out, come together and enjoy the home at your own pace, while the outlook remains a constant reminder of the privileged position you occupy.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home itself, the substantial, predominantly level site is an outstanding advantage. Finding this amount of usable outdoor space in such a premium clifftop position is increasingly rare. There is room for children to play, space to entertain, additional parking for family and visitors, and the freedom to enjoy the property without feeling confined by its elevated coastal setting. A spacious double garage completes the picture, offering secure parking, excellent storage and that all-important extra space for hobbies, tools or the ultimate man cave.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the lifestyle.\r\n\r\nJust a short stroll from your front door, the coastal walkway follows the shoreline, inviting you to explore the natural beauty of the peninsula. Swimming beaches, paddleboarding, fishing, rock pools and scenic coastal walks are all part of the everyday appeal. Whether you enjoy an active outdoor lifestyle or simply appreciate the tranquillity of living beside the sea, this is a location that makes it easy to slow down, get outside and enjoy everything the Hibiscus Coast has to offer.\r\n\r\nDespite its peaceful, elevated setting, you remain connected to the local beaches, amenities and community that make Stanmore Bay such a sought-after place to call home. It is a wonderful balance of privacy, space and coastal convenience.\r\n\r\nOur vendor is firmly committed to their next chapter, creating an exciting opportunity for a new owner to secure a home in a location that is becoming increasingly difficult to find. The combination of expansive sea views, a generous and predominantly level site, excellent living space and an enviable coastal position sets this property apart.\r\n\r\nSome homes offer a place to live. Others offer a lifestyle you will treasure.\r\n\r\nWith its remarkable outlook, exceptional setting and the very best of coastal living on your doorstep, this is a rare opportunity to secure something truly special in Stanmore Bay. Properties offering this combination of position, views and usable land are seldom available. \r\n\r\nCall us now for a private viewing or we will see you at the open homes.",
